        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1780333286\" alt=\"Game Title Banner\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Fusing the methodical decision-making of turn-based strategy with the tactical urgency of an RTS, Mordfield Command puts every turn at the center of humanity’s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity stands overrun and overruled by an algorithm that has seized control of Earth. From a fragile stronghold, contested resources must be reclaimed and territory secured against an enemy that begins with every advantage. Each decision  shapes the momentum of a conflict that will not yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on smart expansion, efficient build orders, and well-timed offensives. The objective is clear: reclaim control or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" aria-label=\"Building expansion gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless attacks accompany every advance, and the enemy grows stronger with each passing day. Expansion is more than growth; reclaiming resources weakens the enemy while strengthening your position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move too slowly and enemy reinforcements will outpace your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" aria-label=\"Defending attacks gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and every piece of scrap is contested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated structures generate additional action points at a power cost, giving you room to reinforce a position or press an attack when it matters. As the war escalates, new technologies unlock stronger defenses and countermeasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemy outposts to disrupt reinforcements before you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war does not slow down, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1780333286\" alt=\"Game Features Banner\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Timed Rounds</strong> — Keep the pressure on by enabling an optional 15 or 30 second turn timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> — Allocate action points at the expense of resources  to maximize your tactical options each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree —</strong> Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> — Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP/Multiplayer</strong> — Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play  custom maps, change turn length, and assert your dominance in head-to-head gameplay.  Play using in-game procedural generated battlefields or custom player-made  ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> — Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> — Battlefields respond to combat and become damaged over time. Damaged areas become harder to traverse and modify offensive and defense bonuses, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> — Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> — An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources—powered by procedural map generation—ensure no two runs play the same.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1780333286\" alt=\"Game Title Banner\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Fusing the methodical decision-making of turn-based strategy with the tactical urgency of an RTS, Mordfield Command puts every turn at the center of humanity’s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity stands overrun and overruled by an algorithm that has seized control of Earth. From a fragile stronghold, contested resources must be reclaimed and territory secured against an enemy that begins with every advantage. Each decision  shapes the momentum of a conflict that will not yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on smart expansion, efficient build orders, and well-timed offensives. The objective is clear: reclaim control or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" aria-label=\"Building expansion gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless attacks accompany every advance, and the enemy grows stronger with each passing day. Expansion is more than growth; reclaiming resources weakens the enemy while strengthening your position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move too slowly and enemy reinforcements will outpace your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" aria-label=\"Defending attacks gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and every piece of scrap is contested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated structures generate additional action points at a power cost, giving you room to reinforce a position or press an attack when it matters. As the war escalates, new technologies unlock stronger defenses and countermeasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemy outposts to disrupt reinforcements before you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1780333286\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1780333286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war does not slow down, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1780333286\" alt=\"Game Features Banner\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Timed Rounds</strong> — Keep the pressure on by enabling an optional 15 or 30 second turn timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> — Allocate action points at the expense of resources  to maximize your tactical options each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree —</strong> Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> — Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP/Multiplayer</strong> — Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play  custom maps, change turn length, and assert your dominance in head-to-head gameplay.  Play using in-game procedural generated battlefields or custom player-made  ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> — Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> — Battlefields respond to combat and become damaged over time. Damaged areas become harder to traverse and modify offensive and defense bonuses, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> — Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> — An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources—powered by procedural map generation—ensure no two runs play the same.</p>",
